{"name":"Elmwood","hex":"#8c7c61","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Elmwood","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["The name of a few places in Canada.","The name of many places in the United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Elmwood"}],"entries":[{"title":"Elmwood, Edmonton","blocks":[{"text":"Elmwood is a neighbourhood in west Edmonton, Alberta, Canada that was a part of the Town of Jasper Place prior to Jasper Place's amalgamation with Edmonton in 1964. It is a residential neighbourhood located to the south east of West Edmonton Mall and to the south west of Meadowlark Health and Shopping Centre. Residents also have ready access to the Misericordia Community Hospital located just north of Elmwood in the neighbourhood of West Meadowlark Park."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/2007-06-21_Elmwood_Compessed.jpg/330px-2007-06-21_Elmwood_Compessed.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elmwood%2C_Edmonton"},{"title":"Elmwood (electoral district)","blocks":[{"text":"Elmwood is a provincial electoral district of Manitoba, Canada."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Manitoba_2018_Elmwood.svg/330px-Manitoba_2018_Elmwood.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elmwood_(electoral_district)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/2007-06-21_Elmwood_Compessed.jpg/500px-2007-06-21_Elmwood_Compessed.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/2007-06-21_Elmwood_Compessed.jpg/500px-2007-06-21_Elmwood_Compessed.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A2007-06-21_Elmwood_Compessed.jpg"},{"s